@div kirugu A

$ at least 15 lines missing
A.1. X X X X X ma-ra-X [...]
#lem: X; X; X; X; X; X; X
#tr.en: …… to you. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.1

A.2. [...] X-da a-ŋi₆ id₂-da kuš₇ su-gin₇ [su-su]
#lem: X; X; aŋi[wave]; id[river]; kuš[devastation]; su[sink]; su[sink]
#tr.en: …… a flood-wave in the river, sweeping over everything like a destructive flood. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.2

A.3. lugal-ŋu₁₀ ŠID-zu-ta im-mi-ni-DU [...]
#lem: lugal[king]; X; X; X
#tr.en: My king, from your ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.3

A.4. lugal u₃-tud-zu-ta he₂-ŋal₂-la saŋ# [...]
#lem: lugal[king]; utud[give birth (to)]; heŋal[plenty]; saŋ[head]; X
#tr.en: King, from your birth you have …… in abundance. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.4

A.5. {d}nin-ŋiš-zid-da za₃-mi₂-zu dug₃-ga-am₃ [X X]
#lem: Ninŋešzidak[1]; zamin[praise]; dug[good]; X; X
#tr.en: @wDN{Ninŋišzida}, your praise is sweet ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.5

@div trailer 

A.6. ki-ru-gu₂ [1-kam-ma-am₃]
#lem: kirugu[division notation in certain literary compositions]; n
#tr.en: 1st @fsux{kirugu}. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.6

@end trailer

@end kirugu

@div kirugu B

B.7. en {d}nin-[ŋiš]-zid-da X X [...]
#lem: en[lord]; Ninŋešzidak[1]; X; X; X
#tr.en: Lord @wDN{Ninŋišzida}, ……  
#etcsl: line-id=B.7

B.8. X [...] X [...] X [...]
#lem: X; X; X; X; X; X
#tr.en: Hero, …… beloved of holy @wDN{An}, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.8

B.9. ur-saŋ X [ki] aŋ₂# an kug-ga
#lem: ursaŋ[warrior]; X; ki[place]; aŋ[measure]; An[1]DN; kug[pure]
#tr.en: …… born in the shining great mountains, lord …… with sparkling eyes, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.9

B.10. AN en X [...]-da kur šuba₄ gal u₃-tud-[da]
#lem: X; en[lord]; X; X; kur[mountain(s)]; šuba[multicoloured]; gal[big]; utud[give birth (to)]
#tr.en: with the attractiveness of a young man, great hero, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.10

B.11. en X [X X] igi gun₃-nu hi-li nam-ŋuruš-a
#lem: en[lord]; X; X; X; igi[eye]; gunu[speckled]; hili[attractiveness]; namŋuruš[manliness]
#tr.en: the king's right arm on the battlefield, Lord @wDN{Ninŋišzida}, 
#etcsl: line-id=B.11

B.12. ur-saŋ gal me₃# sahar-ra-ka a₂ zid-da lugal-la
#lem: ursaŋ[warrior]; gal[big]; me[battle]; sahar[soil]; a[arm]; zid[right]; lugal[king]
#tr.en: your praise is sweet. They praise you in song. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.12

B.13. en {d}nin-ŋiš-zid-da za₃-mi₂-zu dug₃-ga šir₃-re-eš am₃-mi-ni-in-ne
#lem: en[lord]; Ninŋešzidak[1]; zamin[praise]; dug[good]; šir[song]; e[speak]
#etcsl: line-id=B.13

@div trailer 

B.14. ki-ru-gu₂ 2-kam-ma
#lem: kirugu[division notation in certain literary compositions]; n
#tr.en: 2nd @fsux{kirugu}. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.14

@end trailer

@end kirugu

@div kirugu C

C.15. ur-saŋ# ki#-a kul-lu-de₃
#lem: ursaŋ[warrior]; ki[place]; kul[run]
#tr.en: Hero, as you wander on the earth, 
#etcsl: line-id=C.15

C.16. {d}nin#-[ŋiš-zid]-da ki aŋ₂ an kug-ga
#lem: Ninŋešzidak[1]; ki[place]; aŋ[measure]; An[1]DN; kug[pure]
#tr.en: @wDN{Ninŋišzida}, beloved of @wDN{An}, through you the early flood occurs, 
#etcsl: line-id=C.16

C.17. [id₂-da a]-eštub# he₂-e-da-ŋal₂ {d}en-ki he₂-e-da-hul₂
#lem: id[river]; aʾeštub[early flooding]; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]; Enkik[1]DN; hul[rejoice]
#tr.en: and @wDN{Enki} rejoices at you. Through you fine grains are in the fields, 
#etcsl: line-id=C.17

C.18. [a-šag₄-ga] še# gu-nu he₂-e-da-ŋal₂ X [X X he₂-e]-da-hul₂
#lem: ašag[field]; še[barley]; gunu[qualification of barley]; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]; X; X; X; hul[rejoice]
#tr.en: and …… rejoices at you. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.18

C.19. [X X] an-še₃ saŋ il₂-la en {d}nin-ŋiš-zid#-da
#lem: X; X; an[sky]; saŋ[head]; il[raise]; en[lord]; Ninŋešzidak[1]
#tr.en: …… head held high, Lord @wDN{Ninŋišzida}. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.19

C.20. [X X he₂]-e-da-de₂ en {d}nin-ŋiš-zid-da
#lem: X; X; de[pour]; en[lord]; Ninŋešzidak[1]
#tr.en: You ……, Lord @wDN{Ninŋišzida}. You extend ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=C.20

C.21. [... he₂]-e-da-su₃-ud-de₃! umbin he₂-e-da-gid₂-de₃
#lem: X; sud[distant]; umbin[finger]; gid[long]
#tr.en: and you stretch out your claws. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.21

C.22. [en] {[d]}[nin-ŋiš]-zid#-da za₃-mi₂-zu dug₃-ga-am₃ X X
#lem: en[lord]; Ninŋešzidak[1]; zamin[praise]; dug[good]; X; X
#tr.en: Lord @wDN{Ninŋišzida}, your praise is sweet, ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.22

