@end kirugu

@div kirugu D

D.24. [...] X a zid mu-ri-in-ri
#lem: X; X; a[water]; zid[right]; ri[impose]
#tr.en: …… he has poured his good seed. 
#etcsl: line-id=D.24

D.25. {[d]}nin#-ŋiš-zid-da-ra {d}en-lil₂-le silim-ma mu-na-ab-be₂
