D.26. [...] X-ga-ke₄ mu-un-zu-zu kalam-ma mu-e-ši-u₃-tud
#lem: X; X; zu[know]; kalam[the Land (of Sumer)]; utud[give birth (to)]
#tr.en: to @wDN{Ninŋišzida}. 
#etcsl: line-id=D.26

D.27. [X X] X SAR-gin₇ u₃-tud-da
#lem: X; X; X; X; utud[give birth (to)]
