#lem: en[lord]; Ninŋešzidak[1]; zamin[praise]; dug[good]; šir[song]
#tr.en: He looks at your joyful …… Lord @wDN{Ninŋišzida}, your praise is sweet. 
#etcsl: line-id=D.29

